Ms. Huo, go!

00:24:03.280 --> 00:24:05.800
Zheng Xiong Tian Yuan, I have to kill him.

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:06.800
The enemy's firepower is too strong.

00:24:07.040 --> 00:24:07.560
Masao Tahara!

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:08.880
I have to kill him. Let's go.

00:24:09.360 --> 00:24:11.160
Take him away!

00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:14.120
No, I have to kill Masao Tachihara.

00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:15.360
Go!

00:24:21.720 --> 00:24:22.880
Come up.

00:24:24.040 --> 00:24:24.720
Come on.

00:24:27.680 --> 00:24:28.280
Here.

00:24:28.480 --> 00:24:29.200
Eagle.

00:24:44.920 --> 00:24:45.720
Lord Tanihara!

00:24:46.040 --> 00:24:48.520
I didn't expect you to come so fast.

00:24:48.880 --> 00:24:49.600
I received your help.

00:24:49.920 --> 00:24:50.920
A team has arrived.

00:24:51.320 --> 00:24:52.120
Good.

00:24:52.680 --> 00:24:53.520
There's another good news.

00:24:53.800 --> 00:24:54.200
What?

00:24:54.360 --> 00:24:56.360
The main force has arrived in Shanzhou.

00:24:58.160 --> 00:24:59.000
Good.

00:24:59.240 --> 00:25:00.640
Great!

00:25:02.520 --> 00:25:04.120
God is on my side.

00:25:04.600 --> 00:25:06.720
God is on our side.

00:25:14.720 --> 00:25:15.720
I'm sorry

00:25:20.000 --> 00:25:21.200
I've made you suffer.

00:25:25.800 --> 00:25:26.560
Eagle.

00:25:28.640 --> 00:25:30.040
I'm sorry to Madam.

00:25:31.400 --> 00:25:32.520
and you.

00:25:33.040 --> 00:25:34.200
I made you suffer.

00:25:34.480 --> 00:25:36.160
I'm the one who should apologize.

00:25:37.520 --> 00:25:38.520
I misunderstood you

00:25:39.320 --> 00:25:40.720
and shot you.

00:25:43.240 --> 00:25:44.240
It's my fault.

00:25:46.120 --> 00:25:47.040
I'm fine.

00:25:47.280 --> 00:25:48.080
It's all done.

00:25:48.440 --> 00:25:49.640
Don’t worry about it.

00:25:50.440 --> 00:25:52.760
I can figure out how Madam died.

00:25:53.040 --> 00:25:55.160
I didn’t get shot in vain.

00:25:56.040 --> 00:25:57.600
I don't understand.

00:25:58.760 --> 00:26:00.600
A person who watched me grow up.

00:26:01.440 --> 00:26:02.680
who I trust the most.

00:26:04.400 --> 00:26:05.600
He lied to me

00:26:06.160 --> 00:26:06.920
and killed my father.

00:26:07.160 --> 00:26:08.720
and Meixiang’s aunt.

00:26:09.920 --> 00:26:12.000
Why did Uncle He become like this?

00:26:16.720 --> 00:26:18.120
Everything will pass.

00:26:19.120 --> 00:26:19.920
Yes.

00:26:20.760 --> 00:26:21.960
Everything will pass.

00:26:25.040 --> 00:26:26.000
Where is Liu?

00:26:26.920 --> 00:26:28.720
Mr. Liu carried you here.

00:26:29.280 --> 00:26:31.240
He went back to Qinglong Fortress after eating something.

00:26:31.560 --> 00:26:32.960
Why did he go back to Qinglong Fortress?

00:26:33.520 --> 00:26:34.120
You don’t know?

00:26:34.280 --> 00:26:35.200
I can't stop him.

00:26:35.720 --> 00:26:37.240
Mr. Liu is so stubborn.

00:26:37.560 --> 00:26:39.560
He said he couldn’t leave Qinglong Fortress.

00:26:39.920 --> 00:26:41.400
He wants to go back and guard.

00:26:41.680 --> 00:26:43.320
He really loves my father

00:26:43.640 --> 00:26:45.240
to Qinglong Camp.

00:26:45.720 --> 00:26:46.600
Yes.

00:26:47.680 --> 00:26:48.680
Where's Ni?

00:26:49.680 --> 00:26:51.040
Why haven't I seen her?

00:26:53.400 --> 00:26:54.600
Poor Ni.

00:26:54.880 --> 00:26:56.080
Since we saved her,

00:26:56.360 --> 00:26:57.560
she doesn't eat or drink.

00:26:57.880 --> 00:26:59.440
Wen Pei forced her

00:26:59.680 --> 00:27:00.560
to feed her some water.

00:27:00.760 --> 00:27:01.560
No way.

00:27:01.880 --> 00:27:03.880
I'm worried that Ni has a heart disease.

00:27:04.560 --> 00:27:06.640
So many things happened suddenly.

00:27:06.960 --> 00:27:08.720
She's too young to accept it.

00:27:09.720 --> 00:27:10.640
Take me to see her.

00:28:15.440 --> 00:28:16.320
Sister is here.

00:28:20.760 --> 00:28:21.720
Sister

00:28:24.280 --> 00:28:24.960
It's okay.

00:28:25.160 --> 00:28:26.320
We're safe now.

00:28:27.680 --> 00:28:28.480
Sister.

00:28:30.040 --> 00:28:31.000
I'm sorry.

00:28:31.120 --> 00:28:32.120
I'm sorry.

00:28:32.480 --> 00:28:33.680
I'm sorry.

00:28:34.040 --> 00:28:35.560
What are you talking about?

00:28:36.160 --> 00:28:37.640
Why are you sorry?

00:28:39.440 --> 00:28:40.360
Remember,

00:28:40.800 --> 00:28:41.800
no matter what happens,

00:28:42.080 --> 00:28:42.960
you're still my sister.

00:28:43.560 --> 00:28:44.320
Got it?

00:30:00.640 --> 00:30:01.520
Major Tanaka.

00:30:07.880 --> 00:30:10.320
We've successfully entered Shanzhou.

00:30:11.040 --> 00:30:12.320
I need to ask my superiors

00:30:12.640 --> 00:30:14.200
to reward everyone.

00:30:18.880 --> 00:30:19.800
Colonel.

00:30:20.400 --> 00:30:22.720
Mr. Tanihara, long time no see.

00:30:26.160 --> 00:30:26.960
Thank you.

00:30:27.480 --> 00:30:29.800
It's our duty to serve the empire.

00:30:30.440 --> 00:30:33.080
It's all thanks to you

00:30:33.400 --> 00:30:34.520
you deserve all the credit.

00:30:34.920 --> 00:30:36.600
Since you killed

00:30:36.840 --> 00:30:39.120
Shangguan Bao died in your hands,

00:30:39.400 --> 00:30:42.160
the rest of the bandits have no leader.

00:30:42.520 --> 00:30:44.880
and can't get any better.

00:30:46.560 --> 00:30:47.600
Colonel.

00:30:48.040 --> 00:30:50.400
We can't let our guard down yet.

00:30:50.800 --> 00:30:51.960
Our enemy Communist Party

00:30:52.240 --> 00:30:54.680
hasn't given up on drawing on swordsmen.

00:30:54.760 --> 00:30:55.840
So next,

00:30:56.040 --> 00:30:58.480
we must destroy

00:30:58.720 --> 00:31:00.880
one by one.

00:31:01.120 --> 00:31:02.080
Mr. Tanihara.

00:31:02.480 --> 00:31:04.560
This is about the Imperial Army.

00:31:05.320 --> 00:31:06.720
What about you?

00:31:07.080 --> 00:31:09.040
Have you found the treasure map?

00:31:16.080 --> 00:31:18.840
Now I have two maps.

00:31:19.200 --> 00:31:20.480
I still need the third one.

00:31:20.920 --> 00:31:22.560
This picture is very important.

00:31:22.880 --> 00:31:25.200
It is the key to unlock the secret.

00:31:27.120 --> 00:31:28.320
We're here

00:31:28.640 --> 00:31:30.840
to cooperate with you.

00:31:31.640 --> 00:31:33.600
Time is limited and the task is heavy.

00:31:34.360 --> 00:31:36.280
The army line of the empire is too long.

00:31:36.640 --> 00:31:38.880
The military supply is tight.

00:31:39.680 --> 00:31:41.480
If we want to go west as planned,

00:31:41.840 --> 00:31:44.120
the supplies must be solved.

00:31:45.040 --> 00:31:46.280
Don't worry, Colonel.

00:31:46.600 --> 00:31:48.440
I will do my best.

00:31:50.000 --> 00:31:51.520
Now that the devil has occupied the city,

00:31:51.920 --> 00:31:53.640
Half of the poles on the 18 hills fell.

00:31:53.960 --> 00:31:55.720
Some of them fled to the devil.

00:31:55.960 --> 00:31:56.800
Those who don't want to surrender

00:31:57.080 --> 00:31:58.320
hiding everywhere.

00:32:28.640 --> 00:32:29.680
What's going on?

00:32:29.880 --> 00:32:31.960
Aren't you usually good at talking?

00:32:32.200 --> 00:32:33.880
Why are you so quiet now?

00:32:41.960 --> 00:32:43.840
Tell us what you think.

00:32:44.560 --> 00:32:45.560
Let me say it.

00:32:45.920 --> 00:32:48.160
When the kid is happy,

00:32:48.440 --> 00:32:50.200
let’s blow up

00:32:50.480 --> 00:32:52.080
like last time?

00:32:52.360 --> 00:32:54.520
Or we’ll destroy his command center.

00:32:56.120 --> 00:32:56.920
The enemy's current garrison

00:32:57.200 --> 00:32:58.880
at least one team.

00:33:00.640 --> 00:33:01.400
We can't

00:33:01.640 --> 00:33:02.920
with our strength.

00:33:07.280 --> 00:33:08.560
I'll go to the main unit.

00:33:09.800 --> 00:33:11.120
Only by working with them

00:33:11.880 --> 00:33:14.000
to get back where the demons occupy.

00:33:20.200 --> 00:33:22.040
I agree with Choi Mun-bae.

00:33:22.840 --> 00:33:24.000
That's fine.

00:33:24.400 --> 00:33:25.280
How about this?

00:33:25.640 --> 00:33:27.000
I'll go with Wen Pei.

00:33:27.280 --> 00:33:29.120
You'll pass through many enemy occupations along the way.

00:33:29.400 --> 00:33:30.480
I can protect you.

00:33:31.560 --> 00:33:32.360
Okay.

00:33:33.160 --> 00:33:36.120
We can take care of each other.

00:33:36.520 --> 00:33:37.520
No way.

00:33:39.600 --> 00:33:40.520
Vegetable buns.

00:33:42.320 --> 00:33:43.480
You can go wherever you want.

00:33:43.720 --> 00:33:45.360
She... No.

00:33:46.080 --> 00:33:47.280
Brother, stop it.

00:33:48.160 --> 00:33:48.720
I've made up my mind.

00:33:48.960 --> 00:33:49.880
What's your decision?

00:33:50.520 --> 00:33:51.440
You decide to stay here?

00:33:51.680 --> 00:33:52.240
Let me tell you.

00:33:52.480 --> 00:33:53.840
No one can take away

00:33:54.160 --> 00:33:56.280
No one can take her away from me.

00:34:03.120 --> 00:34:03.960
Vegetable buns.

00:34:04.600 --> 00:34:05.960
If you can still breathe,

00:34:06.480 --> 00:34:07.880
help me persuade her.

00:34:08.880 --> 00:34:10.080
You know her personality.

00:34:10.840 --> 00:34:11.840
When she gets stubborn,

00:34:13.199 --> 00:34:14.120
I have no choice.

00:34:19.360 --> 00:34:20.080
Say it.

00:34:23.639 --> 00:34:25.440
I only have one sister.

00:34:32.600 --> 00:34:33.440
Wen Kui.

00:34:35.080 --> 00:34:36.560
You know her better than I do.

00:34:53.719 --> 00:34:54.400
Okay.

00:34:55.320 --> 00:34:56.000
Bao.

00:34:56.800 --> 00:34:58.480
Let alone our childhood friendship,

00:34:58.960 --> 00:35:01.800
Aren't you Communist Party people

00:35:02.080 --> 00:35:03.120
Revolutionary friendship?

00:35:04.680 --> 00:35:06.160
I've never begged anyone.

00:35:06.280 --> 00:35:07.960
I'm begging you today.

00:35:09.600 --> 00:35:10.760
Listen carefully.

00:35:13.640 --> 00:35:15.400
I'll leave my sister to you today.

00:35:16.480 --> 00:35:17.360
As you know,

00:35:18.920 --> 00:35:19.840
she is the only family

00:35:20.080 --> 00:35:21.480
in this world.

00:35:27.320 --> 00:35:29.360
If she loses a hair,

00:35:32.280 --> 00:35:33.960
I'll kill you.

00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:37.040
Where are you going?

00:35:38.720 --> 00:35:40.320
Are you going to see Jang Gong-yeon again?

00:35:40.600 --> 00:35:42.520
He's no better than me now.

00:35:43.760 --> 00:35:44.440
He's my superior.

00:35:44.680 --> 00:35:45.520
I'm his soldier.

00:35:45.840 --> 00:35:47.160
I have my team to lead.

00:35:47.440 --> 00:35:49.240
You know

00:35:49.480 --> 00:35:51.120
what kind of person Jang Gong-yeon is.

00:35:51.520 --> 00:35:52.360
Stay.

00:35:52.640 --> 00:35:53.960
Fight the devil with us.

00:36:04.400 --> 00:36:06.000
Open your eyes and see.

00:36:10.480 --> 00:36:10.560
The thirtieth military base.

00:36:13.560 --> 00:36:14.840
Are you fighting with bandits?

00:36:15.040 --> 00:36:16.360
Choi Moon-Kui, what are you talking about?

00:36:17.360 --> 00:36:18.280
Say that again.

00:36:18.560 --> 00:36:20.320
Niece, don't be angry.

00:36:21.680 --> 00:36:24.080
Brigade Commander Cui is right.

00:36:24.480 --> 00:36:26.160
This is a den of bandits.

00:36:26.520 --> 00:36:27.960
We're not bandits. What are we?

00:36:28.280 --> 00:36:30.800
Brigade Commander Cui is a national army.

00:36:31.800 --> 00:36:32.600
Brigadier Cui.

00:36:32.920 --> 00:36:35.600
Let's go our separate ways.

00:36:36.160 --> 00:36:37.320
Make yourself at home.

00:36:39.680 --> 00:36:41.760
We have different paths.

00:36:42.760 --> 00:36:43.720
Brigade Commander Cui.

00:36:45.040 --> 00:36:45.840
Go ahead.

00:36:46.080 --> 00:36:47.200
Don't come with me.

00:36:47.840 --> 00:36:49.840
Remember what I said.

00:36:59.600 --> 00:37:00.680
Take care of yourself.

00:37:02.280 --> 00:37:03.080
I'm leaving.

00:37:17.200 --> 00:37:18.400
Wait for my news.

00:37:21.320 --> 00:37:22.200
Brother Xi.

00:37:23.600 --> 00:37:26.240
Take care of Wen Pei along the way.

00:37:34.600 --> 00:37:35.440
Buns

00:37:35.920 --> 00:37:38.520
Why is the army like this?

00:37:39.320 --> 00:37:40.080
This...

00:38:14.280 --> 00:38:15.000
Something's up.

00:38:15.200 --> 00:38:16.240
Guys, be alert.

00:38:26.120 --> 00:38:27.440
Mr. He. Mr. He.

00:38:27.720 --> 00:38:28.520
The Japanese are here.

00:38:28.760 --> 00:38:30.200
They surrounded our gate.

00:38:30.600 --> 00:38:31.280
Why are you panicking?

00:38:32.800 --> 00:38:33.560
Take a look.

00:38:49.640 --> 00:38:52.640
Are you surrendering to me?

00:38:52.920 --> 00:38:55.680
Mr. He, isn’t this the shop manager?

00:38:56.000 --> 00:38:57.120
It turns out to be a devil.

00:38:57.880 --> 00:38:58.680
Don't be afraid.

00:38:59.760 --> 00:39:01.040
I'll go take a look.

00:39:02.880 --> 00:39:04.120
Major Tanaka.

00:39:04.960 --> 00:39:06.520
Can I have a word with you?

00:39:21.120 --> 00:39:22.120
Major Tanaka.

00:39:23.200 --> 00:39:24.800
I can surrender.

00:39:26.120 --> 00:39:28.000
But you have to promise me one thing.

00:39:28.480 --> 00:39:29.800
Another condition?

00:39:30.640 --> 00:39:32.480
When can you cooperate with me

00:39:32.760 --> 00:39:33.920
cooperate with me?

00:39:35.000 --> 00:39:36.000
I know.

00:39:37.440 --> 00:39:39.480
I've already lost everything in front of you.

00:39:39.920 --> 00:39:43.040
Now my daughter and Eagle

00:39:43.400 --> 00:39:44.600
are in your hands.

00:39:45.840 --> 00:39:47.720
But if you don’t agree this time,

00:39:48.600 --> 00:39:50.200
I’ll quit.

00:39:50.480 --> 00:39:51.920
You can find whoever you want.

00:39:53.080 --> 00:39:54.360
Are you threatening me?

00:39:56.240 --> 00:39:57.080
Tell me.

00:39:57.800 --> 00:40:00.760
My men here have different ideas.

00:40:01.120 --> 00:40:03.000
Maybe they have their own ideas.

00:40:03.480 --> 00:40:05.600
So please have mercy.

00:40:06.680 --> 00:40:09.600
Those who want to join me will stay.

00:40:10.440 --> 00:40:11.480
If you don't want to,

00:40:12.040 --> 00:40:13.720
please don't make things difficult for them.

00:40:16.000 --> 00:40:17.000
Let them go.

00:40:18.200 --> 00:40:19.120
Anything else?

00:40:20.440 --> 00:40:22.120
I have fulfilled my promise.

00:40:23.000 --> 00:40:24.920
and joined the royal army with Qinglong Fortress.

00:40:26.120 --> 00:40:27.440
Shouldn't you

00:40:28.000 --> 00:40:29.640
let my daughter and Eagle go?

00:40:30.480 --> 00:40:32.120
They are living well in the city.

00:40:32.400 --> 00:40:33.720
Don't worry about that.

00:40:34.080 --> 00:40:36.320
As for those who refuse to surrender,

00:40:36.880 --> 00:40:37.760
I promise you.

00:40:38.120 --> 00:40:39.400
I can let them go.

00:40:40.680 --> 00:40:41.800
Zheng Xiong Tian Yuan.

00:40:43.040 --> 00:40:45.000
You've got Qinglong Fortress.

00:40:46.240 --> 00:40:48.560
Why won't you let us go?

00:40:49.040 --> 00:40:52.360
Am I not clear enough?

00:41:09.560 --> 00:41:11.560
Mr. He, what did the devil say?

00:41:13.200 --> 00:41:14.600
He said

00:41:15.200 --> 00:41:16.640
if we don't surrender,

00:41:17.040 --> 00:41:18.120
he will blow up the fortress

00:41:18.400 --> 00:41:20.920
and turned Qinglong Fortress into ruins.

00:41:21.200 --> 00:41:23.120
Mr. He, what did you say?

00:41:26.640 --> 00:41:27.640
I agreed.

00:41:28.840 --> 00:41:29.640
What do you mean?

00:41:30.040 --> 00:41:31.560
Let's surrender to the devil.

00:41:32.240 --> 00:41:33.160
No way.

00:41:33.640 --> 00:41:34.680
Who wants to surrender?

00:41:35.480 --> 00:41:36.480
Neither do I.

00:41:38.120 --> 00:41:39.160
But there are

00:41:39.680 --> 00:41:41.600
in the village?

00:41:42.440 --> 00:41:43.720
If Master Shangguan

00:41:44.000 --> 00:41:45.200
never surrender.

00:41:45.840 --> 00:41:47.360
I won't surrender. Fine.

00:41:47.760 --> 00:41:49.000
You'll be a cannon fodder for the devil.

00:41:49.400 --> 00:41:50.440
We want to live.

00:41:50.800 --> 00:41:52.080
I have a family.

00:41:52.440 --> 00:41:53.240
We want to live.

00:41:53.600 --> 00:41:54.640
Enough.

00:41:55.440 --> 00:41:56.760
That devil said

00:41:57.160 --> 00:41:58.680
if you don't want to stay,

00:42:00.040 --> 00:42:01.440
we can leave the fortress.

00:42:02.040 --> 00:42:02.960
How about this?

00:42:03.920 --> 00:42:05.400
Go back and tell our brothers.

00:42:06.000 --> 00:42:07.920
If you want to stay, stay.

00:42:08.320 --> 00:42:09.720
If you really don't want to stay,

00:42:11.160 --> 00:42:12.920
ask them to go to the accountant to collect the toll.

00:42:14.120 --> 00:42:16.920
Tell them to be careful on the way.

00:42:59.040 --> 00:42:59.720
Guards!

00:43:22.080 --> 00:43:22.320
Actor table.

00:43:23.160 --> 00:43:23.240
Zhang Wen.

00:43:39.440 --> 00:43:39.640
and actors.

00:43:40.080 --> 00:43:40.240
Su Tianhui, Yang Wanlin, Zhao Dongliang, Chen Yile, Wang Lusheng.

00:43:40.400 --> 00:43:40.520
Yue, Wang, Yang Ziyi, Tian Chenzhe, Deng Kai. Mei Liang Dong.
Li, Yu Hongda, Tian Guofeng, Gong, Fan. Cheng Kaiyan.

00:43:40.680 --> 00:43:40.880
Sun Zhaoqi, Li Shengchung, Yang Haoyu, and Kkokcho.

00:43:41.280 --> 00:43:41.560
to perform.

00:43:41.720 --> 00:43:41.800
Zhang Hongbo, Gong Jianfeng, Li Kaiwu, Zhuang, Tao, Sun Haochun.

00:43:42.000 --> 00:43:42.240
Zhang Hongbo, Gong Jianfeng, Li Kaiwu, Zhuang, Tao Sun Hao.
Wang Jinjun Liu Jiawen.

00:43:42.360 --> 00:43:42.440
Ji, Chao, Zhao Zhigang, Kung, Ji Youyi. Peng Zhenfu.

